        "id": 1038859
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-12-01T12:48:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is required when we have to take decision to delete the conditional client. sockaddr_cmpf is only comparing the sock address whereas in cidr we are checking the mask as well, since CIDR structure recently changed and mask field is seperate from sockaddr.",
      "parentUuid": "8fee34b5_3548c49a",
      "revId": "9e842bbb6d51d564ac37dfb74708b2d36b8193f8",
