      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-12-12T05:33:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t really understand why we need it.  We only ever needed to determine of an IP address was in a CIDR range.  cidr_contains() does that.  \n\nThe difference with  sockaddr_cmpf was that it was used in a comparator loop and returned -1, 0, 1. cmp_sockaddr just returned boolean.\n\nNo functionality/utility has been lost and we have less confusing names.",
      "parentUuid": "df720a0e_449decfe",
      "revId": "9e842bbb6d51d564ac37dfb74708b2d36b8193f8",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
